t-project-autopilot-stop.ps1\n- powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\\tools\\test-project-acceptance-contract.ps1 if touched/affected by contract expectations.\n- powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\\tools\\test-backlog-packer.ps1 if lib/backlog.ps1 changed.\n- powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\\smoke.ps1\n- Commit through штатный driver.\n\nГРАНИЦЫ:\n- Разрешено трогать lib/delivery-contract.ps1, lib/backlog.ps1, relevant tests, and minimal docs only if needed.\n- НЕ менять Add-ProjectBacklogFromMarker semantics, PROJECT_BACKLOG marker ingestion, worker routing, merge, safety, supervisor/watchdog/restart.\n- Это contract-gate atom, не review-board и не acceptance-agent upgrade.\n- Не ослабляй existing gates ради тестов; лучше обнови fixtures до более глубокого contract.\n\nSTATUS: DONE только после tests + smoke + commit.","after_turns":165,"after":{"timeout_pct":0,"avg_sec":162.8,"success_pct":1},"hypothesis_ts":"2026-06-03T23:12:58.3808955Z","type":"verdict","verdict":"worse","ts":"2026-06-05T02:13:00.7225782Z","commit":"1dfcde9fd65747db248ce2828a8ff77e0df75587"}
