e для touched `.ps1`.\n- `powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\\tools\\test-delivery-gate-facts.ps1`\n- `powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\\tools\\test-delivery-gate-shadow.ps1`\n- `powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\\tools\\test-delivery-gate.ps1`\n- `powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\\smoke.ps1`\n- `git diff --check`\n- Commit through штатный driver.\n\nГРАНИЦЫ:\n- Разрешено: `lib/delivery-gate-facts.ps1`, `driver/86-loop-completion.ps1`, `tools/test-delivery-gate-facts.ps1`, `tools/test-delivery-gate-shadow.ps1`, optional focused tests, minimal `OPERATORLESS_DELIVERY_LOOP_PLAN.md` note.\n- НЕ менять `lib/canary.ps1` в этом атоме, если не требуется для compile/test fix.\n- НЕ менять `lib/delivery-gate.ps1` result semantics.\n- НЕ делать Delivery Gate blocking/release promotion.\n- НЕ подменять acceptance canary-результатом; release may stay false due acceptance_pending.\n- НЕ трогать safety/supervisor/watchdog/restart, worker routing/merge, backlog packing.\n- НЕ создавать `control/restart.flag`.\n- STATUS: DONE только после tests + smoke + commit.","after_turns":278,"after":{"timeout_pct":0,"avg_sec":163.82,"success_pct":0.9964},"hypothesis_ts":"2026-06-04T02:05:13.4594954Z","type":"verdict","verdict":"worse","ts":"2026-06-05T23:00:26.7306469Z","commit":"88cac7f72ae9b8cc8a500ceadefa422af7fdc924"}
