{"baseline":{"timeout_pct":0,"avg_sec":127.47,"success_pct":0.965},"task":"[Автозадача из бэклога] [project-autopilot ch6-transition-planner] [[NORMAL]]\n\nPlan 12 linked video transitions from 13 keyframes\n\nWork only in C:\\Users\\rafie\\bridge-projects\\literary-slop-video. Depends on ch6-video-models. Create slopvid/video_planner.py and tests/test_video_planner.py. Implement a pure planner that consumes ScenePlan and the generated Chapter 5 keyframe plan/entries and returns exactly 12 VideoTransitionState/Plan entries: V01 starts at K01 and ends at K02, ..., V12 starts at K12 and ends at K13. Include duration_sec=5, aspect_ratio=9:16, scene_index, action summary from the matching scene, and start/end keyframe ids/paths. It must raise ValueError if scene_count != 12, keyframe_count != 13, or any keyframe path needed for a transition is missing. Commit the change after checks pass.\n\nChapter: Chapter 6: Video Transition Pipeline\nWave: wave-2\nParallel group: video-planner\nDepends on: ch6-video-models\nAcceptance: Default stub inputs produce exactly 12 transition plans. ; Every transition N records start_keyframe_id KNN and end_keyframe_id K(N+1) with no folder-order inference. ; Planner rejects missing keyframe paths before provider generation. ; Transition action text is derived from the matching scene visual/story event.\nChecks: py -m mypy slopvid ; py -m pytest tests/test_video_planner.py tests/test_video_models.py -q -p no:cacheprovider ; py -m ruff check .\n\nFiles: slopvid/video_planner.py, tests/test_video_planner.py","commit":"0c42443738cf6962b61c8c55d3ff9003ec8b1490","type":"hypothesis","ts":"2026-06-06T15:02:19.2429595Z"}
